    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join us for a wonderful afternoon of opera favourites, featuring SOLO’s Chorus and Sabatino Vacca on piano. In celebration of Westdale’s 95th anniversary year there are 95 tickets available for this concert. Each ticket has a difference price - from $1 to $95. Choose your own ticket price! Tickets available at the church or through Eventbrite via Westdale\\'s website. Westdale United Church, 99 North Oval, Hamilton. Office: 905-528-4215. Funds raised go to support Westdale\\'s monthly Community Lunches (providing free lunches and grocery gift cards to over 50 folks from across the city).&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
