        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Dawn Martens will host a pre-chat on Tosca at approximately 6:45 p.m. at the theatre. Seating is not reserved; come early, select a seat, and enjoy the informative chat. Dawn &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://southernontariolyricopera.com/event/opera-pre-chat-on-puccinis-tosca/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading&lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt; &quot;Opera Pre-chat on Puccini&#8217;s Tosca&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
