        "@value": "Special 10th Anniversary Closing Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Please join us for this special closing concert of our 10th Anniversary Season. Returning from our recent production of Tosca are Soprano Maria Vetere, and Tenor Romulo Delgado, along with members of our Youth and Adult Chorus, and full orchestra. We will perform some of the greatest and most beloved moments in Opera! It promises &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://southernontariolyricopera.com/event/special-10th-anniversary-closing-concert/&quot; class=&quot;more-link&quot;&gt;Continue reading&lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt; &quot;Special 10th Anniversary Closing Concert&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
